                            "BOB LAZAR / S-4 FACILITY\n========================\n\nSUBJECT: Robert Lazar.\n\nBob Lazar became widely known after claiming to have worked on reverse-engineering extraterrestrial spacecraft at a facility called S-4 near Area 51.\n\nHIS CLAIMS INCLUDE:\n\n- Nine alleged extraterrestrial craft.\n- Advanced propulsion systems.\n- Element 115.\n- Gravity manipulation.\n- Military secrecy.\n- Unusual security arrangements.\n\nLazar claimed that the craft used an exotic reactor and a gravity-based propulsion system.\n\nHis claims became a major part of modern UFO culture.\n\nRELATED TOPICS:\n\n- Area 51.\n- S-4.\n- Element 115.\n- Reverse engineering.\n- Classified aerospace technology.\n\nJoe Rogan has interviewed Bob Lazar, discussing his alleged work, the facility and the technology he described.\n\nSTATUS: Highly controversial testimony. Not independently verified.",
                        ),

                        "s4-facility.txt": textFile(
                            "S-4 FACILITY\n============\n\nALLEGED LOCATION: NEAR PAPOOSE LAKE, NEVADA.\n\nAccording to Bob Lazar, S-4 was a secret facility used to examine and reverse-engineer extraterrestrial spacecraft.\n\nALLEGED FACILITY FEATURES:\n\n- Underground hangars.\n- Secure access tunnels.\n- Advanced propulsion laboratories.\n- Recovered craft storage.\n- Specially cleared research personnel.\n\nLazar described several different craft designs.\n\nNo independently verified evidence has established the facility as described.",
                        ),

                        "element-115.txt": textFile(
                            "ELEMENT 115 / MOSCOVIUM\n=======================\n\nElement: 115.\nModern name: Moscovium.\nAtomic number: 115.\n\nBob Lazar claimed that an isotope of element 115 was used as a fuel source in an alleged extraterrestrial propulsion system.\n\nHe described a process involving gravitational waves and the manipulation of spacetime.\n\nSCIENTIFIC STATUS:\n\nMoscovium is a real synthetic chemical element.\n\nKnown isotopes are extremely unstable and have very short half-lives.\n\nThere is no verified evidence that element 115 can be used as an antigravity fuel source.\n\nRELATED TOPICS:\n\n- Nuclear physics.\n- Exotic matter.\n- Gravity manipulation.\n- Reverse-engineered technology.",
                        ),

